il #13.\\n2. Record path: `$TMPDIR/delegate-jobs/<uuid>.json`.\\n3. Record shape: whatever is cheapest to implement and parse. That means the existing `PollResult` JSON (camelCase) plus `supervisorPid`, `heartbeatAt` and `resume {model, cwd, capability, sessionId}`.\\n4. Heartbeat: 30s by default. Tests shorten it with a `DELEGATE_HEARTBEAT_MS` environment override. The supervisor is a separate process, so a fake clock cannot be shared with it.\\n5. `watch`: one JSON line per job, in argument order. Exit 0 when all are terminal. On timeout, print the current records and exit 1.\\n6. `watch` on an unknown job id exits 2 at once.\\n7. Bad input to `run` (unknown model, empty prompt) exits 2 with the reas [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/claude/lane-7-tracer.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":12,"content":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01CMJs5MWaBEwL1CDvNE4nU5\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"author:\\tuser\\nassociation:\\towner\\nedited:\\tfalse\\nstatus:\\tnone\\n--\\n## Preflight rulings (owner, 2026-10-01)\\n\\n1. Real detached supervisor; the status file is the only source of truth. The MCP `job_registry` stays untouched until #13.\\n2. Record path: `$TMPDIR/delegate-jobs/<uuid>.json`.\\n3. Record shape: whatever is cheapest to implement and parse. That means the existing `PollResult` JSON (camelCase) plus `supervisorPid`, `heartbeatAt` and `resume {model, cwd, capability, sessionId}`.\\n4. Heartbeat: 30s by default. Tests shorten it with a `DELEGATE_HEARTBEAT_MS` environment override. The supervisor is a separate process, so a fake clock cannot be shared with it.\\n5. `watch`: one JSON line per job, in argument order. Exit 0 when all are terminal. On timeout, print the current records and exit 1.\\n6. `watch` on an unknown job id exits 2 at once.\\n7. Bad [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-9.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":2,"content":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Read-only doc preflight. Do not edit anything. Do not delegate further.\\n\\nRead GitHub issue #9 (`gh issue view 9`) and spec #4 (`gh issue view 4`, plus its comments for the probe findings), then the existing code it builds on: src/status_record.rs, src/runner.rs, src/job_registry.rs, src/stream.rs, src/finalize.rs, src/prompt.rs, src/models.rs, src/capability.rs, tests/e2e.rs, Cargo.toml.\\n\\nList, max 250 words total, one line each:\\n1. Contradictions between #9, #4 and the existing code.\\n2. Defaults or formats nothing states but the lane must pick (job id format, status-record path and JSON shape, heartbeat interval, watch output format, watch exit code on timeout, where the binary target lives).\\n3. Failure cases with no stated behaviour or error output.\\n4. Acceptance criteria that fight the spec or the code.\\nFor each, give your recommended ruling in a few words. End with STATUS line.\\n\\nContext: #7 (the tr [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":4,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"subtype\":\"delta\",\"text\":\" preflight review of\",\"session_id\":\"a4b49908-1fff-436c-8b85-7053cc35540a\",\"timestamp_ms\":1790844177176}","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":40,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_2a62a29c-785c-46f5-8578-c6e93fa186b\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures && gh issue view 9 && gh issue view 4 && gh issue view 4 --comments && gh issue view 7 --comments\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_2a62a29c-785c-46f5-8578-c6e93fa186b\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"cd\",\"gh\",\"gh\",\"gh\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":fals