y `--tool-idle-ms`  [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":476,"content":"{\"type\":\"result\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"duration_ms\":70188,\"duration_api_ms\":70188,\"is_error\":false,\"result\":\"Gathering issues #9, #4, and #7 (with comments) and reading the referenced source files.\\n\\n\\n**1. Contradictions**\\n- #9/#4 require a per-`cwd` cross-process lock; `job_registry` only has in-process `path_lock`. → **Supervisor holds `flock`; MCP unchanged until #13.**\\n- Spec stories 12–13 vs #7 “MCP `job_registry` untouched”: CLI lock won’t block MCP `cursor_run`. → **File lock is authoritative for `cwd`; document dual-interface gap until #13.**\\n- #7: read-write → `--sandbox disabled`; `capability.rs` `Write` stays sandboxed. → **CLI maps read-write to unsandboxed path only.**\\n- `status_record.rs` uses `cursor-delegate-jobs`; #7 rules `delegate-jobs`. → **Supervisor uses #7 path.**\\n- #7 adds `supervisorPid` / `heartbeatAt` / `resume` on records; `PollResult` lacks them. → **Extend serialized record per #7.**\\n\\n**2. #9 unstated defaults**\\n- Lock file location and payload. → [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-11.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":2,"content":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Read-only doc preflight. Do not edit anything. Do not delegate further.\\n\\nRead GitHub issue #11 (`gh issue view 11`) and spec #4 (`gh issue view 4`, plus its comments for the probe findings), then the existing code it builds on: src/status_record.rs, src/runner.rs, src/job_registry.rs, src/stream.rs, src/finalize.rs, src/prompt.rs, src/models.rs, src/capability.rs, tests/e2e.rs, Cargo.toml.\\n\\nList, max 250 words total, one line each:\\n1. Contradictions between #11, #4 and the existing code.\\n2. Defaults or formats nothing states but the lane must pick (job id f