ull/20\\nadditions:\\t592\\ndeletions:\\t0\\nauto-merge:\\tdisabled\\n--\\nFixes #7\\n\\n- New `delegate` binary (`src/bin/delegate.rs`, `src/cli.rs`) beside the MCP server, which is unchanged.\\n- `delegate run` validates input, writes `$TMPDIR/delegate-jobs/<uuid>.json`, starts a detached supervisor (own session and process group), prints the job id and exits. The supervisor runs cursor-agent, writes a heartbeat (`lastHeartbeatAt`, 30s default, `DELEGATE_HEARTBEAT_MS` override), and writes the terminal record with `supervisorPid` and `resume {model, cwd, capability, sessionId}`.\\n- `delegate watch <id>... [--timeout S]` prints o [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-9.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":40,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_2a62a29c-785c-46f5-8578-c6e93fa186b\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures && gh issue view 9 && gh issue view 4 && gh issue view 4 --comments && gh issue view 7 --comments\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_2a62a29c-785c-46f5-8578-c6e93fa186b\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"cd\",\"gh\",\"gh\",\"gh\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":false,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"cd\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"}],\"fullText\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"9\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view 9\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"4\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view 4\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\": [... omitted end of long line]","